<title>UK: SOCCER-LEADING GOALSCORERS IN ENGLISH PREMIER LEAGUE.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-LEADING GOALSCORERS IN ENGLISH PREMIER LEAGUE.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Leading goalscorers in the English</p>
<p>premier league after Saturday's matches:</p>
<p>10 - Ian Wright (Arsenal)</p>
<p>8 - Matthew Le Tissier (Southampton)</p>
<p>7 - Fabrizzio Ravanelli (Middlesbrough), Les Ferdinand</p>
<p>(Newcastle), Alan Shearer (Newcastle)</p>
<p>6 - Marcus Gayle (Wimbledon), Dwight Yorke</p>
<p>(Aston Villa), Robbie Earle (Wimbledon),</p>
<p>Gianluca Vialli (Chelsea)</p>
